WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.169
-We are hanging out
with the star of "Aquaman."

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:05.871
Jason Momoa right there!

00:00:05.871 --> 00:00:08.874
[ Cheers and applause ]
The best.

00:00:08.874 --> 00:00:13.112
In the movie, of course, Aquaman
is a master of the trident.

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:14.414
Where is he?
Okay, there you are.

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:17.650
Oh, my gosh. Dude.
Oh, my gosh. I'm telling you.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.686
I swear to God, every second,
I feel like he might just snap

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:22.555
one of these days,
and I'm just --

00:00:22.555 --> 00:00:24.591
That's how it ends for me.
A trident.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.126
Tonight -- Whew!

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:28.227
I want to test out --
I don't know why.

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:31.297
I want to test out your trident
throwing skills in real life.

00:00:31.297 --> 00:00:33.165
Are you ready for this?
-I'm ready, Jimmy.

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:35.968
-All right, let's check out
our target right here,

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:37.170
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:40.239
Now, look. This is the ocean.
-Yeah!

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:42.041
That's Ocean Master,

00:00:42.041 --> 00:00:43.810
the legendary arch rival
of Aquaman.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:48.047
That's 15 points for his head,
10 for the body.

00:00:48.047 --> 00:00:49.949
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:03.562
[ Laughs ]
-Yes. Take it off.

00:01:03.562 --> 00:01:05.931
-No, no.
-Take it off.

00:01:05.931 --> 00:01:09.068
-It's not --
-Yeah.

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:11.103
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:11.103 --> 00:01:12.605
♪♪

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:15.275
Whoo!

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:19.211
-All right. Here we go.
10 points for the body.

00:01:19.211 --> 00:01:21.414
25 for under the --

00:01:21.414 --> 00:01:24.650
Below the belt.
The jewels of the sea.

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:28.787
And if you hit Nemo or Dory,
that's negative 20 points.

00:01:28.787 --> 00:01:32.024
We'll get three throws each.
I will go first.

00:01:32.024 --> 00:01:34.627
[ Exhales sharply ]
Get ready for this.

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:37.530
[ Drum roll ]

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:40.099
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:40.099 --> 00:01:43.703
♪♪

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:46.372
You sick son of a bitch!

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:50.777
♪♪

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:53.613
[ Applause ]

00:01:58.518 --> 00:02:01.520
-[ Screams ]

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:05.525
[ Shouting ] Aah!

00:02:05.525 --> 00:02:07.460
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:09.262 --> 00:02:12.665
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:14.200
-Oh, my God. Oh, my God.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.435
-Yeah!
-Oh, my God.

00:02:16.435 --> 00:02:18.571
-You better knock
before you come into my house!

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.840
-All right. I'll knock
before I come to your house.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:24.310
What does that mean?
Oh, my gosh.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:29.849
♪♪

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:32.018
[ Glass shatters ]

00:02:32.018 --> 00:02:33.986
♪♪

00:02:33.986 --> 00:02:35.221
I just heard broken glass.

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:37.923
I don't even know
how that's possible.

00:02:37.923 --> 00:02:40.159
Holy moly.

00:02:40.159 --> 00:02:41.794
Ooh!

00:02:41.794 --> 00:02:44.330
♪♪

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.265
-[ Shouts ]

00:02:46.265 --> 00:02:47.699
♪♪

00:02:47.699 --> 00:02:49.568
-That's right. Here we go.
-A tiebreaker. Here we go.

00:02:49.568 --> 00:02:51.037
-I can do it. I can top it.
-You got it?

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:53.873
-Get ready for me, man.
Here we go.

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:56.108
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:56.108 --> 00:03:03.216
♪♪

00:03:03.216 --> 00:03:04.951
-Ohh!

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:07.653
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:07.653 --> 00:03:09.322
♪♪

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:12.191
-Yes!

00:03:12.191 --> 00:03:15.895
For the win! For the win!

00:03:15.895 --> 00:03:17.897
You better knock --

00:03:17.897 --> 00:03:20.266
Ring the doorbell
if you come to my house.

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:22.835
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:25.405
♪♪

00:03:25.405 --> 00:03:27.006
-[ Grunts ]

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:29.241
-Ohh! The winner!

00:03:29.241 --> 00:03:32.912
The one and only Jason Momoa!

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:34.514
[ Laughs ] Jason Momoa.

00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:37.483
Check him out hosting "Saturday
Night Live" this weekend.

00:03:37.483 --> 00:03:40.186
Go see "Aquaman."

00:03:40.186 --> 00:03:43.022
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show." Stick around.

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:49.762
♪♪

